# Meiyume AI Assistant Project Rules

## Project Overview
project:
  name: meiyume_ai_assistant
  language: python
  description: >
    A comprehensive full-stack application with a Streamlit frontend and a Django backend for multiple 
    AI-powered assistants. The system supports CAD analysis, Quality control, Quality RAG Chat, and Complaint management
    through a modular architecture. Each assistant connects to different n8n workflows for AI processing.

